  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ArticlePageData
  helperWasUsedOnThisArticleState: 0
  articleID: https://NewManila/Updates/Recents
  title: Beautification
  headliner: <b>Mayor Denies Street Art Cleanup, Blames Viral Reports On Political
    Sabotage</b>
  bodyText: "Attempting to defuse days of citywide protests, Mayor Johan \"Mang Danny\"
    called an emergency press conference this afternoon to insist that not a single
    historic mural has been painted over and that no \"beautification\" or jail ultimatum
    ever existed. \r\n"
  textBeforeUrl: 'More about this story :'
  externalLinkBodyText: 'Holding up fresh photographs of New Manila''s iconic downtown
    street art completely intact, the mayor claimed that the two viral news reports
    detailing his supposed eradication drive and arrest threats were fabricated "hit
    pieces" engineered by unfavorable political rivals to spark civil unrest. '
  hasExternalLink: 1
  customComments:
  - Hey he once sold me bad copper too !
  - He finally got what he deserved !
  - And I'll gladly do it again !
  - How long has he been doing this ?!
